{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قُلْتُمْ", "translation": "you said"}, {"text": "يَـٰمُوسَىٰ", "translation": "O Musa"}, {"text": "لَن", "translation": "Never (will)"}, {"text": "نَّصْبِرَ", "translation": "we endure"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "[on]"}, {"text": "طَعَامٍۢ", "translation": "food"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدٍۢ", "translation": "(of) one (kind)"}, {"text": "فَٱدْعُ", "translation": "so pray"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "رَبَّكَ", "translation": "(to) your Lord"}, {"text": "يُخْرِجْ", "translation": "to bring forth"}, {"text": "لَنَا", "translation": "for us"}, {"text": "مِمَّا", "translation": "out of what"}, {"text": "تُنۢبِتُ", "translation": "grows"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضُ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "بَقْلِهَا", "translation": "its herbs"}, {"text": "وَقِثَّآئِهَا", "translation": "[and] its cucumbers"}, {"text": "وَفُومِهَا", "translation": "[and] its garlic"}, {"text": "وَعَدَسِهَا", "translation": "[and] its lentils"}, {"text": "وَبَصَلِهَا ۖ", "translation": "and its onions"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "أَتَسْتَبْدِلُونَ", "translation": "Would you exchange"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "that which"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "[it]"}, {"text": "أَدْنَىٰ", "translation": "(is) inferior"}, {"text": "بِٱلَّذِى", "translation": "for that which"}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "[it]"}, {"text": "خَيْرٌ ۚ", "translation": "(is) better"}, {"text": "ٱهْبِطُوا۟", "translation": "Go down"}, {"text": "مِصْرًۭا", "translation": "(to) a city"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّ", "translation": "so indeed"}, {"text": "لَكُم", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "(is) what"}, {"text": "سَأَلْتُمْ ۗ", "translation": "you have asked (for)"}, {"text": "وَضُرِبَتْ", "translation": "And were struck"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمُ", "translation": "on them"}, {"text": "ٱلذِّلَّةُ", "translation": "the humiliation"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَسْكَنَةُ", "translation": "and the misery"}, {"text": "وَبَآءُو", "translation": "and they drew on themselves"}, {"text": "بِغَضَبٍۢ", "translation": "wrath"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That (was)"}, {"text": "بِأَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "because they"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "used to"}, {"text": "يَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "disbelieve"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِ", "translation": "in (the) Signs"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَيَقْتُلُونَ", "translation": "and kill"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ", "translation": "the Prophets"}, {"text": "بِغَيْرِ", "translation": "without (any)"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقِّ ۗ", "translation": "[the] right"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "(was) because"}, {"text": "عَصَوا۟", "translation": "they disobeyed"}, {"text": "وَّكَانُوا۟", "translation": "and they were"}, {"text": "يَعْتَدُونَ", "translation": "transgressing"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when you said, \"O Moses, we can never endure one [kind of] food. So call upon your Lord to bring forth for us from the earth its green herbs and its cucumbers and its garlic and its lentils and its onions.\" [Moses] said, \"Would you exchange what is better for what is less? Go into [any] settlement and indeed, you will have what you have asked.\" And they were covered with humiliation and poverty and returned with anger from Allāh [upon them]. That was because they [repeatedly] disbelieved in the signs of Allāh and killed the prophets without right. That was because they disobeyed and were [habitually] transgressing."}